# Arguing in Russian: с одной стороны, с другой стороны
subtitle: "Weigh an offer and argue in Russian: с одно́й стороны́… с друго́й стороны́, мне ка́жется, я счита́ю, наоборо́т, на твоём ме́сте я бы…"
tags: ["russian","russian opinions","arguing in russian","с одной стороны","russian phrases"]
teaches: ["phrases/arguing","phrases/opinions"]
thumb: "band \"Should Tom say yes?\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"A fifteenth Russian story: a winter diary","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/150-russian-review-15.cast"}

